[2026-10-05T01:58:48.988Z] [INFO]   "summary": "git add README.md README.ru.md .github/workflows/benchmarks.yml && git commit -q -m \"README: why 10,000,000 links and 1,000,000 blog posts are the largest sizes\n\nRun 37228604862 measured links at 100,000,000: one SQLite Memory repetition\ntook 1-1.4 hours, and one SQLite File repetition did not finish in the\nremaining 4.5 hours before the job limit, so even a job per variant would not\nfit. 1,000,000 blog posts take 53-66 minutes in C# (run 37226110636), so ten\nmillions would need several jobs per table, whose variants would then be\ncompared across machines.\" && git push -q origin issue-107-bce58c21006b 2>&1 | grep -v \"^remote\"; git log --oneline -1",
